{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "98191e8ad7bbc73f50b19a5f1b81bba7891aa3b54fb5f3c25bd6e9a68f3eedb2", "ja": "ポカポカな練習", "zh": "暖洋洋的练习", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d407c52554e38fa459424fe539cc4567d562b05da5134de6e8098297d339fc44", "ja": "いよいよ楽曲のレッスンが始まった。\nこの日をとても楽しみにしていた4人。\nレッスン後、育は楽曲が子供っぽいと疑問を\n口にするが「子どもに聞かせるための曲」と\nいうやよいの助言で、前向きな気持ちに！", "zh": "歌曲练习终于正式展开，四个人都非常期待这\n一天。在训练课程后，育提出歌曲太孩子气的\n疑问，但弥生说这是「唱给孩子听的歌曲」，\n让育重新打起精神！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b99d8d71629c589b8a47286a04ce6fef3c74fa719c2198fb5918a1ab5ab7d04f", "ja": "（今日から、新曲のレッスンが始まる。\nみんな、この日を楽しみにしていたみたいだな）", "zh": "（新歌的训练课程从今天开始，\n大家似乎都很期待这一天呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_02_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "63b5f261663a4678a6bcb3105ed3100641cdec69b4c26c2544db45dfd15fe9a7", "ja": "ねえねえ、おやぶん！\n早くレッスン始めようよ！", "zh": "欸欸，老大！\n赶快开始课程吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_02_1002_040tam", "source_sha256": "b994cbb4d2bfa1f061fd90e0a0f858c69b8c65f2099d4bba956e835939d78d12", "ja": "たまき、みんなと一緒に歌えるの、\n昨日からす～っごく楽しみにしてたんだ～♪", "zh": "环从昨天开始就超～级期待\n和大家一起唱歌～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_02_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "40ab87fa4ad5ad6045ee63cf9a55be9af09f2b9d9cf16af647f81964d790f0cc", "ja": "私も、家に帰ってからもず～っとワクワクしちゃって！\nお布団に入っても、なかなか眠れなかったなぁ～。", "zh": "我也是，回家之后也一～直都很兴奋期待，\n就算钻进被窝也睡不着呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_02_1004_040tam", "source_sha256": "e686e2ac5b3241ab3f17aa8c3759d05964f33e5020b38f2197193bed16a69c84", "ja": "わぁ、かなもなんだ！\nくふふ！　たまきといっしょだね！", "zh": "哇，原来可奈也是！\n呵呵！和环一样呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_02_1005_p", "source_sha256": "601e9da2476196b792645fc24bbefcd71f4e61d8e9195afc22899c38907c72b2", "ja": "よし、じゃあ早速始めるか。\nまずは準備運動だ。しっかりやるんだぞ。", "zh": "好，那我们就快点开始吧，\n首先是热身运动，一定要做好喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_02_1006_005yay", "source_sha256": "b68da598c4e3ab7ce63479a2aed0ff412109f9b8e8f9e8f6f64e52cfd2bc9ba1", "ja": "わかりましたっ！\nみんな、準備運動からね。よーい、どーん！", "zh": "我知道了！\n大家要从热身运动开始喔，预备～开始！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_02_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "feb1951ce61c14a52a2efe03ce1348d8b2128bf4994b41cd555e2a3bc728481c", "ja": "環ちゃん、一緒にやろう！\nストレッチするから、わたしの背中を押してくれる？", "zh": "小环，我们一起做吧！\n我想要做伸展，可以帮我压背吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_02_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "b74dbf900fb225960af58858feca38f8cedd133993500d384717232f4eb641cd", "ja": "うん、たまきにまかせて！\n押して押して押しまくるぞ～！", "zh": "嗯，交给环吧！\n环会一直压一直压，压不停喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_02_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "0ab3de09ab004825e4e295a569b16a4a1cfbd350e59e1c56d51996cfae515708", "ja": "準備運動、しゅ～りょ～！\n体、ほぐれたかな～♪　いい声、出せるかな～♪", "zh": "热身运动结～束～！\n身体舒展好了吗～♪能不能唱出好声音呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_02_1010_036kan", "source_sha256": "560bbd8d6588582f2b36cddc2325912ddc987da6cb72490b910a5b896cbaedb6", "ja": "ら～らら～♪　ら～らら～♪", "zh": "啦～啦啦～♪啦～啦啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_02_1011_030iku", "source_sha256": "3c5f1626d1e7422bb1be1620fdd647e971a85794469fb8ae9312501cb1c40ad4", "ja": "可奈ちゃん？　その歌、なんの歌？", "zh": "可奈？那是什么歌？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_02_1012_036kan", "source_sha256": "40fb2600b11e45f8056fceaa0d24bac00d83702731d1524fda3110a250db2c2d", "ja": "えっ？　私達の新曲だけど……？", "zh": "咦？是我们的新歌啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_02_1013_p", "source_sha256": "14fb3e943ac05b3235657720e001d4d34750a24d938c0251255111a9f4b957c7", "ja": "……しっかり練習しような、可奈。\n俺も付き合うから。", "zh": "……好好练习吧，可奈。\n我也会陪你一起的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_02_1014_040tam", "source_sha256": "8b91b7304585c03585f3dd17d4fb3e8746cebca89569e830b1b10679a51bbc55", "ja": "準備運動したら、ポッカポカになっちゃった！\nたまき、まだ体動かしたい！", "zh": "做了热身运动之后，身体就变得暖呼呼的！\n环还想再活动身体！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_02_1015_040tam", "source_sha256": "9d8440571fefa431c87461d49380ab4e4313fd3a9fb78299da2ce94848bfe251", "ja": "おやぶん、近くの公園に石切りしに行こうよ～！", "zh": "老大，一起去附近的公园打水漂吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_02_1016_005yay", "source_sha256": "76cf3b8f40acb4bcfe042f5c6d69de9609c7379fb07adb8758aa7563ccb08b6b", "ja": "環ちゃん、ダメだよ～。\nもう練習が始まるんだから。", "zh": "不行啦～小环，\n练习已经要开始了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_02_1017_p", "source_sha256": "58981a9af498fa1aff4a03a62935475aa76b7926a7d38e8a760e20fd6849acb1", "ja": "そうだぞ。環、みんなと一緒に歌うのを、\nあんなに楽しみにしてただろ？", "zh": "就是说啊，环，你不是还那么期待\n和大家一起唱歌吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_02_1018_040tam", "source_sha256": "ac15e787f6213bb8e94efa5afd3f96fea64e9de5e0268621943509eb95bbe00c", "ja": "あ、そうだった！\nたまき、これからみんなと一緒にレッスンだった！", "zh": "啊，对喔！\n环接下来要跟大家一起参加训练课程！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_02_1019_040tam", "source_sha256": "1c096cf4ed82bd09eefc610932d9f5b01f0d46ebded78bfee8e3ce039a122f52", "ja": "おやぶん、やよいちゃん、教えてくれてありがとー！\nたまき、レッスンで体動かすねっ！", "zh": "老大、弥生，谢谢你们告诉我──！\n环要在课程中活动身体！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_02_1020_p", "source_sha256": "942be59ac98f9d207064efbe550ac4965afe0eba29c2a8983f36741584ded53a", "ja": "元気なのはいいことだ。\nよし、じゃあみっちりやっていくぞ！", "zh": "有活力是件好事，\n好，那就好好认真加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_02_1021_p", "source_sha256": "617541e2e0a0ec14a380e26bc44aff9c9a8bf45b14ea5611f47272023ec2b021", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま！　レッスン初日だし、\n時間もキリがいい。今日はこの辺で終わりにしようか。", "zh": "各位辛苦了！毕竟是第一次课程，\n时间也差不多了，今天就练到这里吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_02_1022_005yay", "source_sha256": "df7614ceaf9423d0fefcffcf379a5d18764439b52ad9b9421435bb246cc70b82", "ja": "ありがとうございましたー！", "zh": "谢谢大家──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_02_1023_036kan", "source_sha256": "df7614ceaf9423d0fefcffcf379a5d18764439b52ad9b9421435bb246cc70b82", "ja": "ありがとうございましたー！", "zh": "谢谢大家──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_02_1024_040tam", "source_sha256": "df7614ceaf9423d0fefcffcf379a5d18764439b52ad9b9421435bb246cc70b82", "ja": "ありがとうございましたー！", "zh": "谢谢大家──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_02_1025_030iku", "source_sha256": "df7614ceaf9423d0fefcffcf379a5d18764439b52ad9b9421435bb246cc70b82", "ja": "ありがとうございましたー！", "zh": "谢谢大家──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_02_1026_040tam", "source_sha256": "66096f25db840f05f0795abe91e0bbf67e7b469ed4dcb154cf20b500ebb34182", "ja": "みんなで一緒に歌うの、楽しかった～！\nたまき、歌いすぎてのどがカラカラだぞ～♪", "zh": "和大家一起唱歌好开心～！\n环唱过头了，喉咙都干了喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_02_1027_036kan", "source_sha256": "b8d3b44527d4aac21cb23e4a62b051f3fff0cd4229284d65da75ce5d840464aa", "ja": "言われてみれば、私もカラカラ……。\nはぅ～、このままだとシワシワになっちゃうかも……。", "zh": "你一说我才发现，我喉咙也干了……\n呜～这样下去说不定会变得皱巴巴的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_02_1028", "source_sha256": "0b40d7241b64bd44a4c5d4457cfb888302cfb05df3c1013e8ad844c4cf1ac4f0", "ja": "そう言うと思ってた", "zh": "就知道你们会这么说", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_02_2000_p", "source_sha256": "a059dcfc45c00cbcc57733a681a3f3e2ece33e0728f19d157f9de52a5fb91d17", "ja": "そう言うと思って、ジュースを買っておいたよ。冷蔵庫\nで冷やしておいたから、しっかり水分を取ってくれ。", "zh": "就知道你们会这么说，所以先买了饮料喔。\n已经先放在冰箱冰着了，好好补充水分吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_02_2001_040tam", "source_sha256": "e64e3a73377937bbf57679fdcab82ce850cf461d545bd41f0d1d51faeee463c2", "ja": "わぁ！　おやぶん、ありがと～！", "zh": "哇！老大，谢谢你～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_02_2002_p", "source_sha256": "22f946de5a91bbe9030fd0b4d531b54867722c1b09ff2ee3ece08731190ad5f3", "ja": "どういたしまして。\n……ん？　やよいは行かないのか？", "zh": "不用客气。\n……嗯？弥生你不去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_02_2003_005yay", "source_sha256": "89c3f749df787028c70117c0dd6a664fe4004c4a777443dcb928bc2dd94fbe59", "ja": "えっと、ストレッチをしてからの方がいいかなーって。\nジュースはその後、いただきますねっ！", "zh": "那个，我想说伸展完再去好了──这样吧。\n我等一下再喝饮料喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_02_2004_030iku", "source_sha256": "3f4e7ba1c0212b585563843b5b1b7143bcbf3eabde1c3801d53573f453d7bd25", "ja": "う～ん……。", "zh": "嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_02_2005_005yay", "source_sha256": "dbb9db5ae7cf21918cbb496eda0c2d0169594f2cf304f1f57a0f3137b9c39fcf", "ja": "あれ、育ちゃんはいかないの？\nなにか困りごと？", "zh": "咦，小育你不去吗？\n有什么烦恼吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_02_2006_030iku", "source_sha256": "8ac5b314d7bd696815ffe8e5fc8c018eb2183a1c7ba65367161b69cf404c1f2d", "ja": "やよいさん……えっと、わたし……。\nみんなと歌うのは、すごく楽しかったんだけど……。", "zh": "弥生姊姊……那个，我……\n虽然很期待和大家一起唱歌……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_02_2007_030iku", "source_sha256": "853b0589625d76247a9bfb1868754804fb63f0a0d681454218d2dcef1534b54b", "ja": "歌ってる時に思ったんだけど、\nこの歌、ちょっと子どもっぽすぎない？", "zh": "但我唱歌的时候想到，\n这首歌是不是太孩子气了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_02_2008_p", "source_sha256": "d87fdb5b0cb0bb91122808ea1802786df2c5284dca32b6b96112303cad420d54", "ja": "子どもっぽすぎる？", "zh": "太孩子气了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_02_2009_030iku", "source_sha256": "df4db973f44399e8333cc600f4ac361925a4fe1a8590e0993f994f373e4a37e8", "ja": "うん。かわいいし、みんなで歌うのは好きだけど……\nなんか、おゆうぎみたいかなって。", "zh": "嗯，虽然很可爱，我很喜欢和大家一起唱……\n但总觉得很像才艺表演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_02_2010_p", "source_sha256": "efaf971120189433b1aee0a3d2e6f1f9ceec6a18b8d00fa98ddb0e0fa7103570", "ja": "ふむ……。\n育、子どもっぽい歌は、やる気が出ないか？", "zh": "嗯嗯……\n育，如果唱孩子气的歌，你就会提不起劲吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_02_2011_030iku", "source_sha256": "beee0fac9840b065bac885d4bad933cf565ed55fa9c904082ea6fc61a05d2170", "ja": "そんなことないよ、お仕事だもん。\nでも、おゆうぎみたいなのは、ちょっと……。", "zh": "才没有那种事喔，因为是工作嘛。\n但像是才艺表演的，就有点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_02_2012_005yay", "source_sha256": "0bea177c96f6543aa2aa7f2ccaa049a1c80e80b1d83c4e1f5d9c32b7a0b5c159", "ja": "そうだ！　大丈夫だよ、育ちゃん。\nこの歌は、きっと子どもに聞かせる歌なのかなーって。", "zh": "对了！没问题的，小育。\n我想这首歌一定是给小孩子听的歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_02_2013_030iku", "source_sha256": "b75f21b7eb88cce99f1b7faa07ff70e9a8941adb2d65e6678c0679b3f9c6b5d0", "ja": "え？　それって、どう違うの？", "zh": "咦？那有什么不一样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_02_2014_005yay", "source_sha256": "5cbbb0f0e2dc98f2fc08e44c290f39261a0216c7557739cdd4a9fdd142aaabb8", "ja": "えへへ、子どもに聞かせる歌といえば～、子守歌！\n子どものために、大人が歌ってあげる歌だよ！", "zh": "嘿嘿，说到给小孩子听的歌～就是摇篮曲！\n是大人为了小孩而唱的歌喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_02_2015_005yay", "source_sha256": "fab41064267d20d33773924ac0dd2e11cc7074d7deedf50d69ef7719ddf45998", "ja": "なかなか眠れない子どもに、おやすみーって。\n弟達に歌ったら、ぐっすり眠っちゃいそうかも！", "zh": "对睡不着的孩子说晚安～这样。\n要是对弟弟们唱，他们说不定一下就会睡着了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_02_2016_030iku", "source_sha256": "d0c7b867631b6b39bbc83cb20024920e7c501cca1aa32a3ff72632cbb3bc2d41", "ja": "そっか、おとなが歌う歌なんだ！　よかった～。\nそれだったら、わたしも歌えそう！", "zh": "是吗，是大人唱的歌呀！太好了～\n这样的话，我应该也能唱了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_02_2017_p", "source_sha256": "e87a387ac570a435998441cc7ec8bcbaf01bdcdd06f45c232673c2badb1bc64d", "ja": "よし、答えが出たみたいだな。みんなで子ども達の\nために歌ってあげられるよう、頑張ろう！", "zh": "好，你们似乎找到答案了呢，大家一起加油，\n努力为孩子们唱歌吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_02_2018_005yay", "source_sha256": "2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a", "ja": "はーい！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
